## Model card

- **Name:** Qoduck (Stealth Model)
- **Short description:** Alibaba's stealth coding model released on Qoder CN platform November 7, 2026. Identity not disclosed; speculated to be a Qwen 4 Max preview or related high-reasoning variant. Offered free to individual users during limited promotion (Nov 7–11, 2026). Removed after promotion ends.
- **Provider / access:** Qoder CN (Alibaba Cloud) — model picker entry `qoduck`. Available only in Qoder CN app (not IDE, JetBrains plugin, or CLI). Individual users only (Free, Pro, Pro+, Ultra plans); enterprise subscribers excluded. Free daily allowance during promotion; standard rate 0.5× Credits after allowance.
- **Release / knowledge:** Promo launch 2026-11-07; promotion ends 2026-11-11 10:00 UTC+8. Model identity undisclosed; knowledge cutoff not published.
- **IDs:** `qoduck` (Qoder CN model picker only). No public API, no Hugging Face, no OpenCode Zen ID.
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 tokens (per community reports / X posts). Not officially confirmed in Qoder docs.
- **Modalities:** Text input/output (coding-focused). Reasoning: yes (supports adjustable thinking intensity). Tool calls: not documented. JSON mode: not documented. No image/audio/video input documented.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Free daily allowance during promotion (0.0× Credits). Standard rate 0.5× Credits (Qoder credit system). No direct $ pricing published. Paid tier via credits after promotion.
- **Architecture:** Undisclosed. Speculated Qwen-family (tokenizer clues). Parameter count not disclosed. Proprietary, not open weights.

